I pushed a reshaped test, without data providers. On 7.4, they would need to become attributes.

Each theme now renders a form with its own name. The renderer caches the blocks of child views by name, so a loop over themes would otherwise reuse the blocks of the previous theme. I also dropped the cases about names like `vars` and `parent`, since the templates never read `form.parent` or `form.vars`.
